body:
I have defined tables with associations:

``` php
// PremiumsTable.php

    public function initialize(array $config)
    {
       parent::initialize($config);

      $this->belongsTo("Offers");
      $this->belongsTo("Users.Users");
    }
```

``` php
// OffersTable.php

    public function initialize($config)
    {
        parent::initialize($config);

        $this->belongsTo("Users.Users");
    }
```

And in controller, if I do query like that:

``` php
   $premium = $this->Premiums->find()
         ->where(['Premiums.id' => $id])
         ->contain([
         'Offers.Users',
         'Users'
   ])
      ->first();

   die(debug($premium));
```

I get offer without user:

