But if I swap "Users" and "Offers.Users"

``` php
   $premium = $this->Premiums->find()
         ->where(['Premiums.id' => $id])
         ->contain([
         'Users',
         'Offers.Users',
   ])
      ->first();

   die(debug($premium));
```

